{"candidateAnswer":"Kayaking and rock climbing at the state park.","evidence":"[D18:2 | 2:47 pm on 12 June, 2023] John: Hey Maria, thanks for your kind words. It's still tough, but I'm finding some comfort in the good memories. Wow, your camping trip sounds awesome! I went on a mountaineering trip last week with some workmates. It was great and helped clear my head. Anything else cool happening in your life?\n[D16:2 | 1:24 pm on 25 May, 2023] Maria: Hey John! Cool that it's going well - you and your friends look like a great team! I'm busy at the shelter getting ready for a fundraiser next week. Hopefully, I can raise enough to cover basic needs for the homeless.","itemId":"urn:uuid:b1ee7150-c887-519c-9aa0-289c9031c798","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:d3d918138b2f8538edfb325aff7cb4eee9368c273753111ced32735869f3caf3","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What outdoor activities has John done with his colleagues?","referenceAnswer":"Hiking, mountaineering","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"d3d918138b2f8538edfb325aff7cb4eee9368c273753111ced32735869f3caf3"}}]}